  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mongolian National Chamber of Commerce and Industry (MNCCI) and Mongolian Employers Federation (MONEF) have a mandate for representing Employers within the National Tripartite Committee on Social and Economic Partnership. As the recognized representatives of Employers, it is crucial that both organizations have the capability to engage in evidence-based policy advocacy as well as deliver value for membership in the form of additional services and assistance to enterprises.

The ILO assists MNCCI in improving working methods, procedures, and governance to enhance institutional capacities, and in conducting surveys on responsible business practices and environmental, social, and governance issues, and developing new member services.

The ILO is also supporting MONEF to introduce new services for its members in relation diversity, equity and inclusion, and occupational safety and health.</narrative>
  </description>
